### =====================
### USERS
### =====================


### Listar usuários

GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Buscar usuário

GET {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Atualizar usuário

PUT {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Novo Nome"
}



### Deletar usuário

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Listar tarefas do usuário

GET {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### =====================
### PROJECTS
### =====================


### Criar projeto

POST {{apiUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Projeto Node",
  "description": "Projeto para testar API",
  "status": "active"
}



### Listar projetos

GET {{apiUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Buscar projeto

GET {{apiUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Atualizar projeto

PUT {{apiUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Projeto Atualizado",
  "status": "completed"
}



### Deletar projeto

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Listar tarefas do projeto

GET {{apiUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### =====================
### TASKS
### =====================


### Criar tarefa

POST {{apiUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Criar endpoint",
  "description": "Criar endpoints da API",
  "priority": "high",
  "projectId": 1
}



### Listar tarefas

GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Buscar tarefa

GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Filtrar concluídas

GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks?completed=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Filtrar prioridade

GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Ordenar

GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks?sort=deadline&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Atualizar tarefa

PUT {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tarefa atualizada",
  "priority": "medium"
}



### Deletar tarefa

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Completar tarefa

PATCH {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### =====================
### ASSIGN TASK USERS
### =====================


### Atribuir usuários

POST {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [
    1
  ]
}



### Remover usuário da tarefa

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



